      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A green brachiosaurus with a wide oval body, a long cylinder neck stuffed firmly to stand upright, a small sphere head, and four sturdy capsule legs. The long neck is the main structural challenge: pack it with stuffing as you go rather than waiting until the end."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
