        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew all four legs to the underside of the body, with the front pair slightly forward of the body centre and the rear pair near the tail end. Attach the neck to the front-top of the body at a slight forward angle. Join the head to the top of the neck."
          }
